+    "        \"name\": \"gpt-4\",\n",
+    "        \"parameters\": {\n",
+    "            \"api_key\": \"xxx\",\n",
+    "            \"organization_id\": \"xxx\",\n",
+    "            \"temperature\": 0.0\n",
+    "        }\n",
+    "    }\n",
+    "]"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "id": "0072fc64",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "Second, let's start the three agents in the debate. Note that each agent here will automatically starts a sub-process, and the `reply` method is executed within the sub-process."
